# Testing

Every important business rule should have regression coverage. Do not weaken tests merely to make them pass.

## Calculation tests

Location: `packages/math-engine/tests/*.cjs`, `packages/plan-domain/tests/*.cjs`

For calculation changes, test:

- normal values
- zero values
- boundary values
- missing values where applicable

Fixtures use invented round numbers, never plausible real-world campaign data.

## Before declaring work complete

- run targeted tests
- run the full test suite
- run the production build
- inspect the complete diff

```bash
npm run test -w @wings/math-engine    # targeted math
npm run test -w @wings/plan-domain    # targeted plan-domain
npm test                            # full suite + classification guard
npm run build                       # production build
```

Report actual command output. Do not claim success you have not observed.

## User-facing changes

Verify the workflow in the browser. Use the `ui-review` skill for manager-perspective review.

Primary flow: Campaign Setup → Path to Victory → Program & Budget → Adopt Plan.

Check desktop and mobile (390px) for major workflows.

## Pre-release

Use the `release-check` skill before release or production deployment.
